gh varied areas<br><br>• Turn-based combat system<br>• Over 20 varied characters that can be upgraded<br>• Hero leveling and skill tree<br>• Numerous artifacts with unique properties and a spellbook<br>• Highly detailed character models and game locations<br>• Bonus quests, dungeons and endless arenas<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.poster.avif?t=1776327916\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.webm?t=1776327916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/632020/extras/7561ea720e6359690f6dba17ae152565.mp4?t=1776327916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
